---
args: {"senses": "OperationalSense[]", "bridges": "MeaningBridge[]", "handoffs": "RoleHandoff[]", "inquiry": "IntegrationInquiry"}
returns: "IntegrationScenario[]"
---
Take representative actual cross-team situations from supplied sources. Walk each party's expected steps with the proposed meaning bridges and role interfaces; mark a step both teams expect the other to perform. Include the counterexamples from non-equivalent senses. Keep unowned critical handoffs and discarded source distinctions as scenario failures. Re-evaluate only affected scenarios after a changed bridge, while preserving prior scenario editions. This is a semantic rehearsal, not evidence that any external system executed.
